#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524072"
msgid "……you hear…… open your eyes, Prae……\nYou're sleepi…… you'll…… fade awa……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524156"
msgid "Don't be deceiv…… your mind…… Master!\nThis…… a trap…… to ensnare you……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524240"
msgid "No…… pen your eyes…… my Darling……!\nIf you keep…… falling……\nYou won't ever…… up again!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524340"
msgid "Pain suddenly rushes through my left hand.\nWondering why, I check the back of it……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524428"
msgid "I don't remember seeing it before.\nI wonder if I hurt myself somewhere……?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524504"
msgid "I don't remember seeing it before.\nI wonder if I hurt myself somewhere……?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524580"
msgid "The pain soon subsided.\nMaybe it was just a dizzy spell.\nI take a deep breath and pull myself together."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524684"
msgid "…it's just,\nI feel like I heard an extremely familiar voice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524748"
msgid "The pain soon subsided.\nMy left hand is working fine, so maybe I just got a bit dizzy.\nI take a deep breath, pull myself together,\nand move on ahead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524900"
msgid "This is the main gate.\nIf I leave through here, I can go home."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524964"
msgid "But there's still something bothering me.\nI should go see #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF in the garden."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525068"
msgid "The Archery Club is holding morning practice.\nIt's almost time for class,\nso they're in the middle of cleaning up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525184"
msgid "The Archery Club is practicing on the range.\nSeeing the club members concentrating on their targets,\nit'd be awkward for an outsider like me to disturb them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525344"
msgid "It's the school's back gate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525376"
msgid "I've heard that students who're late\nsneak into the building through here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525452"
msgid "But classes haven't started yet,\nso there's no one like that here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525520"
msgid "It's the school's back gate.\nIt's always closed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525572"
msgid "I remember hearing students who live nearby\nsay that if they could get through here,\nthey could sleep in for five more minutes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525700"
msgid "It's the side entrance.\nIf I want to enter the school,\nI should use the #C000246204main entrance#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525804"
msgid "It seems like I can't get into school from here.\nThe door is locked."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525876"
msgid "Past here is the gymnasium.\nI should #C000246204head into the school building#CDEF\nand attend homeroom first."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525988"
msgid "This door leads to the gymnasium.\nBut there's no reason to go there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "526060"
msgid "\"Recruiting members!\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "526084"
msgid "There's a drawing of a cute girl in a lion costume.\nYou can tell it's a poster for the kendo club\nfrom how she's holding what looks\nlike a bamboo sword in her right hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "526256"
msgid "Various drinks are lined up inside the vending machine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "526312"
msgid "…unfortunately, I don't have any change on me.\nI'll pass for now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "526380"
msgid "#[He][She]# shoots!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "526400"
msgid "The ball hit the net with a thump, slowly rolled back,\nand eventually returned to its original position."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "526508"
msgid "#[He][She]# shoots!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "526528"
msgid "――――Or I would have, but even if I wanted to,\nI can't really kick the ball while wearing a skirt.\nSo, I settled for an enthusiastic yell."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "526672"
msgid "Maybe they used it during gym class\nand then just left it here……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "526740"
msgid "This is the stand for morning assemblies."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "526784"
msgid "It's infamous for placing the curse of lengthy speeches\nupon anyone who climbs on it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "526872"
msgid "Oh, sorry, it's nothing.\nI was just a little dizzy. I'm alright now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "526944"
msgid "I feel like I'm not actually myself……\nThere's no way that's……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527012"
msgid "Some students are saying that they've tried\nto leave via the school gate,\nbut they always end up turning back around."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527132"
msgid "No way that's true, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527160"
msgid "Hey hey, let's drop by the station today\nbefore going home."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527220"
msgid "Ahh, I can't wait for classes to end.\nI wanna hang out with you already."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527296"
msgid "I know! Since we're going anyway,\nwhy don't we go now? Let's just skip school!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527376"
msgid "Ah…… c-come on, I was just joking!\nAhaha…… a joke, just a joke……\nI was just messing around a bit……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527484"
msgid "I left the volleyball club because I have\nexams this year. Now I've gained weight……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527572"
msgid "Around here, see?\nIt's embarrassing for a disciplinarian,\nisn't it? But……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527648"
msgid "My main thread doesn't have \"self-training\"\nin it…… which means I keep putting on weight.\nIsn't this some kind of fatal bug?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527776"
msgid "Or maybe it's harassment? What if God\ndecided that I get to be the chubby girl now?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527860"
msgid "Oh, here you are.\nI've got a message from the Editor in Chief."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527924"
msgid "She wants to talk, so go see her after school.\nNo wonder you're the Newspaper Club's ace―\nyou're expected to do big things."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "528052"
msgid "I've delivered the message.\nDon't blame me if you forget later."
msgstr ""

